    """Same card look as _settings_table_stylesheet, but with QTableView type
    selectors so it also styles a plain QTableView (the editor Logic Map table).
    Qt QSS type selectors match a class and its subclasses only — a QTableWidget
    selector does NOT match a plain QTableView. QTableView selectors are a strict
    superset (they also match QTableWidget), so this is safe to reuse anywhere."""
    return (_settings_table_stylesheet(dark)
            .replace('QTableWidget::item', 'QTableView::item')
            .replace('QTableWidget QLineEdit', 'QTableView QLineEdit')
            .replace('QTableWidget {', 'QTableView {'))


